    refactor(tools): optimize string allocations in hot paths

    - Phase 1: Reduce unnecessary String allocations in performance-critical code
    - Changed Vec<String> to Vec<&str> in MCP server specs (line 259)
    - Eliminated canonical.to_string() by using &str directly (line 335)
