    - These changes reduce allocations in the tool execution loop which runs on every agent turn

    Performance impact:
    - specs() call: 1 allocation eliminated per startup
    - execute() call: 1 allocation eliminated per tool dispatch
    - walk() call: 1 allocation eliminated per directory entry processed

